<title>UK: CNA sets 2.3 bln FFR Nov'08 fungible domestic bond.</title>
<headline>CNA sets 2.3 bln FFR Nov'08 fungible domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible domestic bond was announced by joint lead managers CDC Marche and CNCA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE NATIONALE DES AUTOROUTES</p>
<p> AMT    2.3 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    13.NOV.08</p>
<p> TYPE   FUNGIBLE	ISS PRICE  100.309   PAY DATE   S23.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.3	 REOFFER    99.359    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  FRANCE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    55 BP     SELL CONC  75 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH ORIGINAL ISSUE ON COUPON DATE TOTAL</p>
<p>		SIZE THEN 4.2 BLN FRENCH FRANCS</p>
<p>London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
